    "text": "thejoltnews.com\nwebsite\nThurston County, Washington\nPlease don't rename Thurston County 'Scherer Water County'\nBy David Scherer Water,\n6 hours agoBy endorsing the ‘Maintain The Name’ campaign, I risk seeming aligned with those who celebrate Sam Thurston for his racist ideas. Yet, despite the promise of immortality (having the county named after me), I still oppose it. Sam Thurston, for whom our county is currently named, believed that...",
